l structure (T1-T2-T3, T7-T8-T9 potential) and multiple pairs (W9-W9, T7-T7). The W6-W7-W8 chow can still be completed naturally through draws, and exposing it now would sacrifice concealment bonuses without significant strategic advantage.\n\nAnswer: Pass"}
